  "text": "\r\n\t\t Election Information | Newmarket, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Services   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk - Tax Collector's Office \nElection Information \r\nElection Information\t\t \r\nSupervisors of the Checklist Meeting \nOctober 28, 2026 \nNewmarket Town Hall Auditorium \n5:00 pm - 5:30 pm \nThis will be the last time to register to vote prior to the State General Election on November 3, 2026. \nYou can always register to vote at the polls on Election Day! \nState of New Hampshire General Election - November 3, 2026 \nLocation: Newmarket Jr/Sr High School \nPolling Hours: 7 am - 7 pm \nAdditional Links/Information \nNH Secretary of State Website \nWho is my State Legislator? \nNH House of Representatives \nWho is my State Senator? \nNH Senate \nState of NH Voter Information Lookup \nVoter Information Lookup \nVisit for the following information: \nAbsentee Ballot Search - If you applied for an absentee ballot, you can find out if the clerk has received your request; when the absentee ballot was sent to you; and when it was received back in the clerk's office \nParty Information - If you are not sure what party you are registered as on the checklist, you can check it using this link \nPolling Place Search - Find out where your polling place is in your town or ward for state elections \nClerk Information Search - Find out who your clerk is and where the town office is located \nState List - Clerks and Polling Places - You can download a list of all town clerks and their contact information, as well as where the polling places are across the state with the hours of polling. \r\n\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Application  \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Copies Price List \r\n\t\t\t Dog License \r\n\t\t\t Election Information \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registrations \r\n\t\t\t NH Hunting & Fishing License \r\n\t\t\t Notary Services \r\n\t\t\t OHRV Registration \r\n\t\t\t Property Values Online Database \r\n\t\t\t Tax Collection \r\n\t\t\t Town Reports - Provided by the New Market Historical Society \r\n\t\t\t Trash Bags & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Where Your Tax Dollars Go \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Permits \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \r\n\t\t\t Subscribe to Alerts / News \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Newmarket \n186 Main Street \nNewmarket, NH 03857 \nPhone:  603-659-3617 \nTown Hall Office Hours \r\nQuick Links \r\n         FAQs \n         Job Opportunities \n         Events \n         News \n         Website Notifications \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
